    Takes inputs: {'part': {'type': 'number', 'description': 'Numerator of the fraction (e.g., interest income).'}, 'whole': {'type': 'number', 'description': 'Denominator of the fraction (e.g., total other income).'}, 'decimals': {'type': 'integer', 'nullable': True, 'description': 'Number of decimal places to round the result to.  Defaults to ``2``.'}}
    Returns an output of type: number
